{"id":"vyvesti","lemma":"вывести","pos":"verb","rank":1814,"glosses":["to take out, to lead out, to bring out, to move out; to help out (help someone to get off)","to withdraw, to call off (troops)","to derive, to conclude, to infer, to deduce"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/11/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%8B%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%8B%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"выведу","2s":"выведешь","3s":"выведет","1p":"выведем","2p":"выведете","3p":"выведут"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"выведи","2p":"выведите"}}},"past":{"m":"вывел","p":"вывели","f":"вывела","n":"вывело"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"выводить","examples":[{"text":"Выведите её отсюда.","en":"Get her out of here.","words":[null,{"g":"her"},{"g":"from here, hence"}]},{"text":"Выведи их отсюда.","en":"Get them out of here.","words":[null,{"g":"them / their"},{"g":"from here, hence"}]},{"text":"Нам надо вывести отсюда этих людей.","en":"We have to get these people out of here.","words":[{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"must, necessary"},null,{"g":"from here, hence"},null,{"g":"people, humans","l":"люди"}]},{"text":"Ты вывел меня из себя.","en":"You've caused me to lose my temper.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"from / out of"},{"g":"oneself"}]},{"text":"Выведите собаку!","en":"Take the dog for a walk.","words":[null,null]}]}